WEBVTT

01:43.960 --> 01:45.720
Your story is flawless.

01:47.360 --> 01:48.720
This whole explanation,

01:48.800 --> 01:51.360
you must've planned for years, didn't you?

01:58.200 --> 01:59.280
Xiaohe.

02:04.080 --> 02:05.240
Officer He.

02:06.480 --> 02:08.880
I even admitted I pushed my own mother

02:08.960 --> 02:11.000
off a cliff by accident.
I told you that myself.

02:11.080 --> 02:13.120
So making up anything else,
what would be the point?

02:13.200 --> 02:14.840
How would that help me?

02:20.640 --> 02:21.480
Oh, right.

02:22.880 --> 02:26.360
Officer, that question you asked…

02:28.000 --> 02:29.160
I didn't tell the truth.

02:31.520 --> 02:34.760
In '97, July 2nd,

02:36.960 --> 02:38.080
I wasn't home.

02:39.360 --> 02:41.600
That morning,
I went to the provincial capital

02:41.680 --> 02:44.040
and bought a Bowls dress.

02:44.120 --> 02:47.640
Then, I rushed back
to Weiyang to return it.

02:49.240 --> 02:50.320
Why did you do that?

02:50.400 --> 02:52.000
To avoid suspicion.

02:52.600 --> 02:54.160
To erase the purchase record.

02:55.400 --> 02:59.360
Then it can't be traced back to the dress
at Xu Meng's place.

02:59.440 --> 03:00.600
NOTE: NEW FOR OLD, BOUGHT IN CAPITAL
RETURNED IN WEIYANG

03:00.680 --> 03:02.440
If you can't trace Yao Xincheng,

03:03.520 --> 03:05.240
then you can't trace me.

03:06.640 --> 03:07.920
Qiao Suqing,

03:08.480 --> 03:10.320
too bad you planned it all

03:10.920 --> 03:12.600
and still missed one thing.

03:13.880 --> 03:15.280
In your story,

03:15.360 --> 03:16.920
there's a fatal flaw.

03:18.400 --> 03:21.640
You said Xu Meng
was killed by Wu Shanlong in '97.

03:21.720 --> 03:23.880
And those shoes, you got them in 2002.

03:24.400 --> 03:28.080
So why did we find
Xu Meng's DNA in those shoes?

03:37.040 --> 03:38.160
SKIN TISSUE FOUND INSIDE SUBMITTED SHOES

03:38.240 --> 03:39.200
STR PROFILE MATCHES XU MENG'S HAIR SAMPLE

03:39.280 --> 03:41.760
So, how are you going to explain that?

03:46.720 --> 03:48.160
I have no idea.

03:48.840 --> 03:50.480
Wu Shanlong is a psycho.

03:50.560 --> 03:52.560
Nothing he does would surprise me.

03:54.440 --> 03:55.480
Maybe,

03:56.960 --> 03:59.600
after killing Xu Meng,

04:00.400 --> 04:01.440
he kept her underwear.

04:02.640 --> 04:05.440
Then when he saw
the blue heels on the rack,

04:07.920 --> 04:09.320
and it reminded him of her,

04:10.800 --> 04:13.800
so he stuffed the underwear
into the shoes.

04:14.360 --> 04:15.880
That's how the skin cells got there.

04:17.079 --> 04:18.920
That's possible, right?

04:26.840 --> 04:28.600
Back then, with Uncle Ran,

04:29.480 --> 04:30.920
did you make up the same story?

04:32.640 --> 04:34.000
Ran…

04:34.920 --> 04:37.560
He never doubted me back then.

04:40.400 --> 04:41.800
Nor would he frame me.

04:45.600 --> 04:46.760
Officer He.

04:48.080 --> 04:49.360
At this point,

04:49.960 --> 04:51.600
I admit everything I've done.

04:53.400 --> 04:54.840
But anything I didn't do,

04:54.920 --> 04:57.000
I won't admit to any of it.

04:58.800 --> 05:00.280
I've told you everything I should.

05:01.400 --> 05:03.040
If there are more questions,

05:05.520 --> 05:07.000
I won't answer any of them.

05:08.600 --> 05:09.680
Qiao Suqing,

05:09.760 --> 05:11.560
are you going to resist till the end?

05:14.400 --> 05:17.040
You lied to Uncle Ran
and to me and my dad for years!

05:17.120 --> 05:19.400
Don't you feel any guilt or unease?

05:21.160 --> 05:22.320
Officer He.

05:23.720 --> 05:25.240
Ran once said

05:26.200 --> 05:29.280
police rely on evidence.

05:33.560 --> 05:35.160
Otherwise, it's all speculation.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.280
Didn't he

05:40.440 --> 05:41.520
teach you that?

06:24.000 --> 06:24.840
Uncle He.

06:26.000 --> 06:27.040
I'm done.

06:27.680 --> 06:29.400
More and I won't be able to hold it.

06:36.600 --> 06:37.840
Did you find anything?

06:39.520 --> 06:42.160
Right now, we're running bloodstain tests.

06:42.240 --> 06:43.440
Waiting on results.

06:43.520 --> 06:44.680
How about your side?

06:47.840 --> 06:51.280
I told you, Qiao Suqing isn't that simple.

06:53.360 --> 06:55.200
This place was wrecked too thoroughly.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.920
We can't find any usable evidence for now.

06:57.560 --> 06:59.480
We used luminol on the walls and floor.

06:59.560 --> 07:01.400
No positive blood reaction.

07:26.000 --> 07:27.040
Dad,

07:27.920 --> 07:29.600
what do you think about
Qiao Suqing confessing

07:29.680 --> 07:31.040
to killing her mother?

07:32.200 --> 07:34.280
She pushed her off a cliff.

07:35.080 --> 07:36.440
From what we see,

07:36.520 --> 07:38.880
it was hypothermia causing hallucinations

07:38.960 --> 07:40.400
that led to a breakdown.

07:41.560 --> 07:43.560
At most, involuntary manslaughter.

07:44.080 --> 07:48.560
She confessed to this
just to cover up a bigger crime.

07:51.600 --> 07:53.280
A bigger crime…

07:53.360 --> 07:55.120
Eighteen years.

07:55.640 --> 07:59.880
A murderer never left the scene.

08:00.760 --> 08:02.880
She must have more secrets to hide.

08:04.360 --> 08:07.480
We don't even have direct evidence
that she killed Xu Meng and her father.

08:08.600 --> 08:10.280
Other secrets…

08:10.360 --> 08:11.800
We can't even start.

08:17.520 --> 08:18.360
Do you think…

08:18.440 --> 08:19.280
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

08:19.360 --> 08:22.440
-…Uncle Ran found it back then?
-He must have.

08:22.520 --> 08:24.040
Given his personality,

08:24.560 --> 08:26.920
he wouldn't send me
something like that lightly.

08:27.720 --> 08:29.400
He was so meticulous.

08:30.600 --> 08:33.240
He must've kept the evidence back then.

08:34.000 --> 08:35.159
But…

08:36.880 --> 08:38.559
where is it now?

08:44.159 --> 08:45.840
DE-PARADOXIFICATION IN CRIMINAL CASEWORK

08:49.680 --> 08:53.800
EVERY EVENT HAS A CENTER
BEYOND IT, RIPPLES SPREAD

08:57.880 --> 08:59.560
We missed similar cases.

09:01.000 --> 09:03.680
If we take Qiao Suqing as the center,

09:03.760 --> 09:05.280
then the deaths tied to her,

09:05.360 --> 09:06.960
besides Xu Meng and her father,

09:07.040 --> 09:08.360
there were "accidental" deaths too.

09:09.480 --> 09:10.880
One was Yao Baiyuan in '96.

09:10.960 --> 09:13.200
Qian Dajun said
he knocked over a paint bucket

09:13.280 --> 09:14.200
and fell to his death.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.240
Another was Wu Shanlong in 2002.

09:24.840 --> 09:27.080
He also slipped on oil
and fell to his death.

09:28.200 --> 09:30.040
Their deaths are too similar.

09:31.040 --> 09:32.640
Could these not be accidents,

09:32.720 --> 09:35.080
but Qiao Suqing killed them on purpose?

09:42.920 --> 09:45.160
Dad, what's wrong?

09:47.200 --> 09:49.240
Your Uncle Ran's accident scene…

09:50.480 --> 09:51.840
There was oil on the ground too.

10:30.280 --> 10:31.520
Qiao?

10:45.200 --> 10:48.120
SIR

10:50.800 --> 10:51.720
Ran,

10:54.600 --> 10:55.680
it's New Year…

11:32.800 --> 11:34.240
Qiao Suqing…

11:35.920 --> 11:38.120
How could she do that to Uncle Ran?

11:40.080 --> 11:42.960
Back then, weren't they still…?

11:44.160 --> 11:45.200
Unless

11:46.440 --> 11:48.760
she knew Uncle Ran had found out about her

11:48.840 --> 11:50.080
and wanted to silence him.

11:53.800 --> 11:55.440
If she really did it,

11:57.280 --> 11:59.280
I'll kill her myself.

11:59.880 --> 12:00.480
DAHUIHUANG, PATTIA CLUB
JIN MANSHAN, ZHAO HONGMEI

12:05.320 --> 12:08.160
Kiddo, don't rush.

12:09.640 --> 12:11.760
This is just speculation.

12:12.520 --> 12:14.040
We have no proof.

12:18.840 --> 12:19.720
Evidence…

12:21.640 --> 12:24.680
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

12:28.400 --> 12:29.680
Yao Baiyuan,

12:30.400 --> 12:31.560
Wu Shanlong,

12:32.920 --> 12:33.920
Ran…

12:36.200 --> 12:38.280
They all died in "accidents".

12:40.480 --> 12:42.200
These are similar cases.

12:42.920 --> 12:44.600
And at each scene,

12:45.200 --> 12:46.520
there was construction.

12:47.360 --> 12:50.120
On the ground, there was oil residue.

12:50.960 --> 12:52.560
That's the killer's method.

12:53.560 --> 12:54.440
Exactly.

12:55.680 --> 12:58.080
Qiao Suqing must've set
the trap in advance,

12:58.800 --> 13:00.440
then found ways

13:01.280 --> 13:02.560
to lure them in.

13:02.640 --> 13:06.400
The parking lot entrance
was opened last week!

13:06.480 --> 13:08.480
-He might be able to exit from there!
-Stop!

13:09.960 --> 13:10.640
Move!

13:18.720 --> 13:21.720
SONG QINGSONG LIVES IN 1703
OFTEN BRINGS DIFFERENT GIRLS TO 1703

13:23.880 --> 13:25.000
Back then,

13:26.560 --> 13:29.440
Qiao Suqing deliberately
helped us catch Wu Shanlong.

13:30.320 --> 13:33.120
So she could lure him
into the trap she set.

13:39.800 --> 13:41.960
In 2003, on New Year's Eve…

13:43.840 --> 13:45.080
-Qiao.
-Officer He.

13:46.040 --> 13:47.840
Ran didn't come with you?

13:48.560 --> 13:51.800
I thought something had come up at work
and kept him busy.

13:51.880 --> 13:54.680
He was supposed to pick me up from work.

13:54.760 --> 13:57.400
I waited, and he never showed.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.560
He didn't answer my calls either.

13:58.640 --> 13:59.840
I was worried you would all
be waiting too long,

13:59.920 --> 14:02.240
so I took a taxi here.

14:02.960 --> 14:05.600
When Qiao Suqing came, she said herself

14:06.160 --> 14:08.040
Uncle Ran would pick her up.

14:09.160 --> 14:11.320
Jiangdong Road was under construction,

14:11.400 --> 14:13.680
and it was on his route.

14:13.760 --> 14:16.040
She went ahead and set it up.

14:18.040 --> 14:19.960
She killed Uncle Ran

14:21.320 --> 14:22.480
and then came to our place.

14:27.840 --> 14:32.000
Kiddo, Qiao Suqing's detention
only lasts 24 hours.

14:32.600 --> 14:35.560
Right now, we've got 13 hours left.

14:36.200 --> 14:37.400
Let's cover both sides.

14:37.480 --> 14:39.280
Go find Zhao Jie,

14:39.360 --> 14:40.840
coordinate with traffic police,

14:40.920 --> 14:42.960
get footage from back then
near the crash site.

14:43.040 --> 14:44.080
Check the surveillance.

14:44.680 --> 14:47.480
See if Qiao Suqing was there.

14:48.080 --> 14:49.440
I'll have a good think about

14:49.520 --> 14:52.760
where Ran might've hidden the evidence.

14:57.640 --> 14:58.560
Kiddo!

15:01.160 --> 15:03.400
Don't let anger get the best of you.

15:06.080 --> 15:07.880
At this point,

15:08.720 --> 15:10.800
this is no longer about solving the case.

15:12.320 --> 15:14.880
This is a showdown between us and her.

15:16.720 --> 15:18.360
Stay calm.

15:23.040 --> 15:23.880
Don't worry.

15:26.040 --> 15:27.840
I'm a cop first and foremost.

15:51.920 --> 15:52.960
Ran…

15:54.120 --> 15:56.240
Where did you put the evidence?

15:58.080 --> 16:00.440
Did Qiao take it?

16:02.440 --> 16:04.800
Or was it burned?

16:28.880 --> 16:29.960
JIAJIA COLA

16:31.760 --> 16:33.280
It's my fault.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.360
All my fault.

16:42.400 --> 16:45.880
I'm the one who put you in danger.

16:51.800 --> 16:53.000
Oh, right.

16:53.080 --> 16:54.240
New Year's is next week.

16:54.320 --> 16:56.960
On New Year's Eve, come over for dinner.

16:57.520 --> 17:01.680
Bring Qiao too.
We'll all have a family meal.

17:01.760 --> 17:02.800
Don't forget.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.839
It was me who got you killed.

17:25.880 --> 17:26.800
Sir,

17:28.240 --> 17:29.560
if it were you,

17:30.600 --> 17:32.360
how would you keep investigating?

17:38.640 --> 17:42.280
QIAN DAJUN

17:44.480 --> 17:47.240
Officer Ran, I saw Ma Qiang's note.

17:47.320 --> 17:48.680
What do you need?

17:49.200 --> 17:50.320
Manager Qian,

17:50.400 --> 17:54.040
do you know anyone named
Yao Xincheng in Yuanlongli?

17:54.800 --> 17:56.400
Yeah, I know him.

17:56.480 --> 17:57.840
Yao Xincheng.

17:57.920 --> 18:00.480
That's him. He kept that woman in 415.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.480
What's her name… Qiao…

18:03.000 --> 18:04.160
Qiao Suqing.

18:08.280 --> 18:09.480
RECORD OF INTERROGATION

18:13.600 --> 18:15.520
INTERROGATION RECORD

18:19.880 --> 18:22.800
Captain Zhao,
this is Qian Dajun's interrogation video.

18:23.800 --> 18:25.480
Get Qiao Suqing's too.

18:25.560 --> 18:26.680
-I want to review everything.
-Got it.

18:29.520 --> 18:30.520
Don't you knock?

18:31.840 --> 18:33.240
What's wrong, Xiaohe?

18:38.800 --> 18:40.000
WEIYANG TRAFFIC MANAGEMENT BUREAU

18:44.640 --> 18:45.920
-Wu.
-Qu, what a surprise.

18:46.000 --> 18:48.280
-Come sit!
-No, it's fine.

18:48.360 --> 18:49.280
Need a favor.

18:49.360 --> 18:51.800
I need to check all the surveillance

18:51.880 --> 18:54.160
from around Jiangdong Road
on New Year's Eve 2003.

18:54.240 --> 18:55.680
2003?

18:56.440 --> 18:57.480
It's not that I won't help.

18:57.560 --> 19:01.160
Citywide traffic footage
for one day is massive.

19:01.240 --> 19:03.080
We don't even have enough storage
for the past year.

19:03.160 --> 19:04.880
And you want to check footage
from 12 years ago?

19:04.960 --> 19:06.480
-That's impossible--
-I don't care!

19:06.560 --> 19:07.960
Figure it out! I want it checked!

19:09.760 --> 19:12.520
Twelve years ago,
unresolved crash footage…

19:13.080 --> 19:14.520
Archives might still have it.

19:14.600 --> 19:15.760
Want to dig through it?

19:15.840 --> 19:17.400
-Yes!
-Yes.

19:18.320 --> 19:19.160
Captain Qu,

19:20.440 --> 19:21.720
on New Year's Eve 2003,

19:21.800 --> 19:24.560
heavy rain, slippery roads,
lots of accidents.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.800
Take your time.

19:25.880 --> 19:26.800
I'll be next door. Call me if needed.

19:26.880 --> 19:27.800
Okay. Thanks.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.760
Captain Qu, if Uncle Ran's accident scene

19:36.840 --> 19:38.960
was tampered with
by Qiao Suqing beforehand,

19:39.040 --> 19:40.360
then start from there

19:40.440 --> 19:42.320
and work outward,
check all roads leading in,

19:42.400 --> 19:43.720
then we might find her.

19:43.800 --> 19:45.000
Good idea.

19:45.080 --> 19:46.880
I'll dig into it. I've got experience.

19:46.960 --> 19:47.960
Give me more.

19:56.920 --> 19:58.040
Captain Qu,

19:59.080 --> 20:00.080
thank you.

20:00.680 --> 20:01.760
No need.

20:03.080 --> 20:05.280
Captain Ran wasn't just your uncle,

20:05.360 --> 20:07.560
he was my captain and my partner.

20:08.480 --> 20:10.040
This time, no matter what,

20:10.560 --> 20:12.560
we'll find out exactly how he died.

20:13.080 --> 20:14.000
Otherwise,

20:15.040 --> 20:16.960
I don't deserve this badge.

20:20.440 --> 20:21.520
Qu,

20:22.840 --> 20:24.000
a New Year's gift.

20:24.600 --> 20:26.320
Steep it and drink it. It helps grow hair.

20:27.320 --> 20:30.200
Captain, that's so thoughtful. I…

20:32.360 --> 20:33.440
Happy New Year.

20:33.960 --> 20:35.360
You too. I'll get going.

20:50.640 --> 20:52.880
JIANGDONG WEST ROAD

21:15.240 --> 21:17.360
RAN FANGXU'S PATH

21:24.160 --> 21:25.000
Ran…

21:25.680 --> 21:28.160
Where did you put the evidence?

21:28.840 --> 21:31.200
Why do I have no clue now?

21:41.600 --> 21:42.440
Hey.

21:42.520 --> 21:45.280
Mr. He, are you okay?

21:46.080 --> 21:47.240
I'm fine.

21:47.320 --> 21:49.400
Go handle your work.

21:49.480 --> 21:50.840
Don't worry.

21:51.360 --> 21:53.840
Qu and Xiaohe
are checking traffic footage.

21:54.560 --> 21:56.440
I'm reviewing Qiao Suqing's interrogation.

21:56.520 --> 21:58.600
Seeing if she slipped up anywhere.

21:59.360 --> 22:00.200
By the way,

22:00.280 --> 22:02.720
Ran's belongings… Who sorted them?

22:02.800 --> 22:04.560
Could something be missing?

22:06.200 --> 22:08.360
I handled his home myself, personally.

22:08.440 --> 22:09.400
Nothing should be missing.

22:09.480 --> 22:12.160
As for police items,
Wang Mangkun sorted them.

22:12.240 --> 22:13.400
Need me to ask him?

22:13.480 --> 22:14.640
I can have him call you.

22:14.720 --> 22:17.360
No need. I'll contact him myself.

22:17.440 --> 22:19.120
That's it for now.

22:20.920 --> 22:21.800
Mr. He…

22:21.880 --> 22:22.720
Go on.

22:24.640 --> 22:25.920
You've been through a lot

22:28.440 --> 22:29.360
these past two years.

22:30.400 --> 22:33.440
You've stuck with this case

22:34.440 --> 22:35.600
and his last wish.

22:37.800 --> 22:38.840
About this…

22:41.840 --> 22:42.840
I feel guilty.

22:45.600 --> 22:46.440
I…

22:48.520 --> 22:49.760
was too late to realize.

22:53.000 --> 22:54.880
I failed as a detective.

22:59.240 --> 23:00.400
But don't worry.

23:02.280 --> 23:04.080
From now on, I'll give it everything.

23:04.800 --> 23:07.600
I'll do whatever it takes
to find the truth.

23:08.240 --> 23:11.160
I won't let the one who killed him go.

23:12.680 --> 23:14.040
Nor will I let him

23:15.880 --> 23:17.120
die without answers.

23:23.480 --> 23:24.560
You kid,

23:25.680 --> 23:27.920
it's not too late to think like this.

23:28.840 --> 23:30.320
Get back to work.

23:31.360 --> 23:32.240
I'm hanging up.

23:50.280 --> 23:51.240
JIANGDONG WEST ROAD

23:52.560 --> 23:53.560
JIANGDONG NORTH ROAD

23:55.520 --> 23:57.400
‎JAN 31, 2003. 2:35:20 PM
‎JIANGXI EAST ROAD

24:06.240 --> 24:07.320
‎JAN 31, 2003. 4:24:16 PM
‎JIANGDONG SOUTH ROAD

24:10.400 --> 24:11.760
‎JAN 31, 2003. 8:00:06 PM
‎JIANGXI MID ROAD

24:13.640 --> 24:14.760
‎JAN 31, 2003. 7:30:51 PM
‎JIANGDONG NORTH ROAD

24:19.880 --> 24:21.520
‎JAN 31, 2003. 7:26:31 PM
‎JIANGDONG MID ROAD

24:27.040 --> 24:28.040
Xiaohe,

24:29.560 --> 24:30.680
take a look.

24:31.680 --> 24:34.320
Can you tell if it's Qiao Suqing?

24:47.400 --> 24:48.440
Don't rush.

24:48.520 --> 24:49.840
Let's keep checking outward.

24:50.480 --> 24:52.240
If not at night, then check daytime.

24:52.840 --> 24:54.440
We'll find her.

25:17.840 --> 25:20.160
MAJOR LANDSLIDE HIT MOUNT WU
IN KUNHAI YESTERDAY

25:33.160 --> 25:35.360
Sir, be careful.

25:35.440 --> 25:37.160
Did you forget about your blood pressure?

25:38.120 --> 25:40.560
Ran, what took you so long?

25:40.640 --> 25:42.080
I've got so much to ask.

25:42.680 --> 25:44.680
Back then, when you found Qiao Suqing,

25:45.240 --> 25:48.640
you must've had solid evidence, right?

25:53.600 --> 25:55.440
Then where did you put it…

26:09.760 --> 26:12.000
Sir, what did you say?

26:12.080 --> 26:13.240
I can't hear you.

26:14.760 --> 26:15.880
I said,

26:15.960 --> 26:20.640
the evidence you used
to identify Qiao Suqing, where is it?

26:27.760 --> 26:28.600
What did you say?

26:30.320 --> 26:31.400
Hold on!

26:37.120 --> 26:38.200
Go ahead!

26:40.800 --> 26:41.840
Oh.

26:51.080 --> 26:53.000
You… Don't worry about me!

26:53.760 --> 26:55.840
I'm doing fine!

26:55.920 --> 26:58.080
Xiaohe's fine too!

26:58.160 --> 26:59.520
Zhao Jie's fine!

26:59.600 --> 27:01.640
We're all doing well!

27:01.720 --> 27:03.080
So don't worry!

27:16.120 --> 27:17.160
Ran…

27:23.480 --> 27:24.560
Ran…

27:25.480 --> 27:26.760
Ran…

27:29.640 --> 27:30.840
Ran…

28:09.640 --> 28:12.640
ICU FAMILY VISITING ROOM

28:13.720 --> 28:15.680
Doctor, how's my dad?

28:15.760 --> 28:16.600
Which one is your dad?

28:17.240 --> 28:18.600
This one.

28:18.680 --> 28:20.560
Don't worry. He's not in danger.

28:20.640 --> 28:23.440
But he has weak vessels,
overworked lately,

28:23.520 --> 28:25.280
and missed his meds,

28:25.360 --> 28:27.920
triggering an ischemic stroke.

28:28.000 --> 28:30.080
He needs to stay for observation.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.240
Thank you, Doctor.

28:31.320 --> 28:32.160
You're welcome.

28:33.960 --> 28:34.840
Manager Ma, thank you.

28:34.920 --> 28:36.200
It's nothing, really.

28:36.280 --> 28:38.120
It's our job.

28:38.200 --> 28:39.320
As long as Yuanlongli stands,

28:39.400 --> 28:42.440
I'll do my duty as property manager.

28:42.960 --> 28:43.880
By the way,

28:44.640 --> 28:47.320
this was in Mr. He's hand
when he collapsed.

28:47.400 --> 28:49.760
It took effort to pry it out.

28:50.320 --> 28:51.840
I'll head back first.

28:51.920 --> 28:53.520
If you need anything, just call me.

28:54.120 --> 28:55.800
-Thanks.
-No problem.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.480
What happened?

29:09.560 --> 29:10.520
I was on the phone with him,

29:10.600 --> 29:11.520
and he suddenly fainted?

29:11.600 --> 29:12.800
Doctor said it's nothing serious.

29:12.880 --> 29:14.680
Just overwork triggering his condition.

29:16.440 --> 29:17.880
That's a relief.

29:18.560 --> 29:19.600
How about this?

29:19.680 --> 29:21.400
Work can wait. Put it aside.

29:21.480 --> 29:22.840
Stay and take care of him.

29:22.920 --> 29:23.800
Captain…

29:24.440 --> 29:27.600
My dad's in there, and I can't help much.

29:27.680 --> 29:30.800
I'd rather work the case
and find the truth.

29:34.400 --> 29:36.200
The June 30 case is reopened.

29:36.280 --> 29:38.040
Xiaohe should lead it.

29:38.120 --> 29:40.760
The team and I will back her up.

29:41.760 --> 29:43.160
And besides, solving it

29:43.760 --> 29:45.240
isn't just Ran's wish,

29:45.760 --> 29:47.280
it's He Yuanhang's too.

29:55.520 --> 29:56.360
Alright.

29:56.880 --> 29:58.200
Talk to the doctor,

29:58.280 --> 30:00.040
-then get back ASAP.
-Thank you, Captain.

30:06.040 --> 30:07.960
Before I came, I found another clip.

30:08.040 --> 30:10.720
Same woman with the umbrella.
I copied it for you.

30:11.320 --> 30:12.960
Two drives left to check.

30:13.040 --> 30:14.160
I'll head back and continue.

30:14.760 --> 30:15.600
Captain Qu!

30:17.920 --> 30:19.120
Thank you.

30:21.000 --> 30:22.240
What's with you?

30:22.320 --> 30:23.640
Thanking me twice today.

30:24.680 --> 30:27.840
Last time, it was for my uncle.

30:28.960 --> 30:31.800
This time, it's for my dad.

30:40.360 --> 30:42.600
The two of us worked together for years.

30:44.400 --> 30:45.800
Seeing him now,

30:46.320 --> 30:48.680
lying there against his will…

30:50.440 --> 30:51.760
It just

30:53.120 --> 30:54.560
doesn't feel good.

31:03.240 --> 31:05.360
When he's better, tell him

31:05.960 --> 31:07.400
he owes me one.

31:08.520 --> 31:09.560
I'm off.

31:11.360 --> 31:12.800
Captain Qu!

31:41.240 --> 31:44.360
FAIR AND JUST

31:44.440 --> 31:45.680
This whole explanation,

31:46.200 --> 31:48.920
you must've planned for years, didn't you?

31:50.040 --> 31:51.080
Xiaohe.

31:55.000 --> 31:55.880
JULY 1, WEDNESDAY

31:55.960 --> 31:59.000
I even admitted I pushed my own mother
off a cliff by accident.

31:59.080 --> 32:00.600
I told you that myself.

32:01.120 --> 32:03.240
So making up anything else,
what would be the point?

32:14.040 --> 32:15.560
CAPTAIN'S OFFICE

32:18.240 --> 32:19.840
Captain, reporting in.

32:19.920 --> 32:21.960
Qiao Suqing is assisting now.

32:22.040 --> 32:23.320
If we can't detain her,

32:23.400 --> 32:25.880
in three hours, the hold expires.

32:25.960 --> 32:27.680
Then we'll have to release her?

32:27.760 --> 32:29.440
Why so eager?

32:29.520 --> 32:30.480
We've got three hours.

32:30.560 --> 32:32.200
Get out! Don't bother me!

32:32.960 --> 32:33.840
Okay.

32:44.600 --> 32:47.600
COMPREHENSIVE SOCIAL SECURITY MANAGEMENT

32:55.640 --> 32:58.400
Qu said you made some progress
with the surveillance.

32:58.480 --> 32:59.760
Why are you just sitting here?

33:00.360 --> 33:02.280
The footage, it's just a lead.

33:02.800 --> 33:04.440
We still lack proof.

33:06.040 --> 33:08.160
This note my dad wrote
before he collapsed…

33:08.240 --> 33:09.960
I keep thinking,

33:10.040 --> 33:13.040
could it be linked to what
Uncle Ran found?

33:19.800 --> 33:22.680
Captain Zhao said before Mr. He collapsed,

33:23.200 --> 33:26.280
he asked about Ran's belongings.

33:26.360 --> 33:29.320
Back then, I handled that.

33:29.840 --> 33:31.880
I even went back and checked again.

33:31.960 --> 33:33.480
It was all routine files.

33:33.560 --> 33:38.920
Whether paper or digital,
nothing stood out.

33:43.720 --> 33:45.320
Digital…

33:47.360 --> 33:48.520
The office system?

33:48.600 --> 33:49.720
No way.

33:49.800 --> 33:53.440
I took over his account
and internal email.

33:54.120 --> 33:55.680
Nothing unusual.

33:55.760 --> 33:57.640
I remember that morning,

33:57.720 --> 33:59.320
he rushed back,

33:59.400 --> 34:01.760
didn't even greet anyone,
and went straight into his office.

34:01.840 --> 34:03.240
Wait… I remember.

34:03.320 --> 34:05.040
I went in that day.

34:05.560 --> 34:07.040
It's New Year… Why are you still busy?

34:07.840 --> 34:08.800
Nothing.

34:09.440 --> 34:11.679
Writing a case summary email.

34:11.760 --> 34:12.600
What case?

34:12.679 --> 34:13.760
I never heard of it.

34:15.920 --> 34:20.320
He was at his desk, said he was writing
a case summary email.

34:20.920 --> 34:23.560
That day, did any of you get his email?

34:28.360 --> 34:30.440
Could it be an internal email to my dad?

34:30.520 --> 34:31.679
No.

34:31.760 --> 34:33.760
Back then, he never used computers.

34:33.840 --> 34:36.800
His system account and internal email…

34:36.880 --> 34:37.880
He never used them.

34:39.159 --> 34:41.800
But the system account
is just full-name pinyin.

34:43.320 --> 34:46.880
Wait, you handle retired accounts, right?

34:46.960 --> 34:47.840
Captain,

34:48.760 --> 34:53.320
I actually came across Mr. He's account
while organizing the system.

34:53.400 --> 34:55.360
What are you waiting for? Log in, now.

34:55.440 --> 34:57.000
After I saw it,

34:58.120 --> 34:59.560
I deleted it.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.680
Why so eager?

35:10.880 --> 35:14.280
Liu, can you restore a deleted account?

35:14.360 --> 35:15.960
A deleted account,

35:16.040 --> 35:17.440
if it needs recovery,

35:17.520 --> 35:19.960
we'd have to send the main drive
to the city IT center.

35:20.040 --> 35:21.480
That won't work. How long would that take?

35:21.560 --> 35:22.760
I need it now.

35:22.840 --> 35:24.880
Captain, that's beyond us.

35:24.960 --> 35:27.560
We're cops, not hackers.

35:33.040 --> 35:33.960
Hackers?

35:35.960 --> 35:38.520
Check up and down, left and right…

35:39.040 --> 35:41.360
-He's a hacker.
-A hacker?

35:42.200 --> 35:43.560
I'm not a hacker.

35:43.640 --> 35:45.840
You got the wrong guy. I'm innocent.

35:45.920 --> 35:47.680
-Take him first!
-Move!

35:47.760 --> 35:49.280
-Wait…
-Come on.

35:49.360 --> 35:50.600
Where? My computer…

35:50.680 --> 35:51.960
Where are we going?

36:00.400 --> 36:03.520
POLICE USE ONLY

36:10.400 --> 36:11.720
Relax.

36:11.800 --> 36:13.160
We just need help on data recovery.

36:13.240 --> 36:14.640
It's approved.

36:14.720 --> 36:16.040
Handled technically.

36:16.120 --> 36:18.320
It's all legal and secure.

36:19.280 --> 36:20.280
Make way!

36:20.360 --> 36:22.000
Here's fuel for him.

36:22.080 --> 36:23.560
Here. Drink up.

36:41.000 --> 36:43.800
The system's hard drive… ever replaced?

36:43.880 --> 36:45.000
No.

36:45.960 --> 36:47.200
Five minutes.

37:21.680 --> 37:23.000
ENTER PASSWORD

37:26.160 --> 37:27.440
The data's still there.

37:28.520 --> 37:29.800
It's encrypted.

37:30.320 --> 37:31.600
If you don't know the password,

37:31.680 --> 37:33.720
I can install a hacking tool

37:33.800 --> 37:35.480
-and crack it.
-Are you crazy?

37:35.560 --> 37:37.920
Installing random software
on police computers?

37:38.000 --> 37:39.520
You want jail time?

37:45.200 --> 37:46.280
I'll try.

37:55.040 --> 37:56.520
ENTER PASSWORD

37:56.600 --> 37:57.440
ERROR

38:00.880 --> 38:02.240
I'll try a birthday.

38:02.320 --> 38:08.040
ENTER PASSWORD

38:08.120 --> 38:08.880
ERROR

38:14.160 --> 38:15.560
Wait!

38:15.640 --> 38:17.160
Last try.

38:17.240 --> 38:18.360
One more and it locks.

38:37.680 --> 38:39.480
Your teacher said

38:40.160 --> 38:41.760
you ranked

38:42.360 --> 38:43.480
last in finals.

38:46.680 --> 38:48.120
Last place is fine.

38:48.640 --> 38:49.760
Not so bad.

38:52.280 --> 38:53.800
Last place and still fine?

38:54.800 --> 38:55.720
Tell me…

38:56.600 --> 39:00.120
If someone stands on Earth
and keeps walking south,

39:00.720 --> 39:01.720
where do they end up?

39:03.520 --> 39:05.280
Keep going south…

39:06.480 --> 39:07.480
as far south as possible.

39:12.160 --> 39:14.680
You'll reach the South Pole.

39:15.280 --> 39:17.280
But once you're there,

39:17.360 --> 39:20.360
any direction you go
won't be south anymore.

39:22.120 --> 39:25.040
Xiaohe, we're both at the bottom.

39:26.280 --> 39:28.680
Your birthday's March 31.

39:29.200 --> 39:31.080
Mine's June 30.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.680
Last day of the month.

39:34.280 --> 39:35.760
But think of it…

39:36.520 --> 39:40.520
The next day after our birthdays
is always a new month.

39:42.080 --> 39:43.560
I like that.

39:51.560 --> 39:52.960
It's my dad's account.

39:53.480 --> 39:56.240
Uncle Ran wouldn't use his own birthday.

40:01.080 --> 40:03.840
ENTER PASSWORD

40:07.120 --> 40:08.080
GOOD EVENING, HE YUANHANG

40:09.480 --> 40:10.560
Got it!

40:16.480 --> 40:18.480
INBOX: 0 UNREAD

40:19.920 --> 40:21.640
There's nothing.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.040
Check drafts.

40:25.720 --> 40:27.720
DRAFTS

40:27.800 --> 40:28.920
JUNE 30 CASE REINVESTIGATION REPORT

40:34.120 --> 40:38.360
"Dear leaders, colleagues,
this is He Yuanhang."

40:38.440 --> 40:41.000
As a recognized contributor
to the June 30 case,

40:41.520 --> 40:44.760
I have a duty to report the findings

40:44.840 --> 40:46.880
of the reinvestigation as follows…

40:48.640 --> 40:51.160
He already wrote a report.

40:51.240 --> 40:52.760
Why keep investigating?

40:53.800 --> 40:55.080
He lost his memory.

40:56.080 --> 40:57.200
What do you know?

40:57.280 --> 40:58.400
This must have been written
by Captain Ran.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.960
He didn't want to affect
He Yuanhang's merit award,

41:01.040 --> 41:04.200
so he put the credit on He Yuanhang.

41:06.160 --> 41:08.600
JUNE 30 EVIDENCE

41:11.480 --> 41:12.320
JUNE 30 EVIDENCE

41:12.400 --> 41:14.200
EVIDENCE LIST, EVIDENCE LOCATIONS

41:14.280 --> 41:16.280
EVIDENCE LIST

41:21.080 --> 41:21.920
PROPERTY PICTURE OF EVIDENCE

41:22.000 --> 41:23.120
DRESS

41:23.200 --> 41:24.400
OCTAGONAL LAMPSHADE

41:24.480 --> 41:25.480
CEMENT FRAGMENTS

41:27.600 --> 41:28.680
EVIDENCE LOCATIONS

41:36.520 --> 41:37.800
Captain Ran's toolbox.

41:39.280 --> 41:40.520
It's at my place.

42:10.600 --> 42:11.640
Officer Ran,

42:12.560 --> 42:13.880
what are you doing here?

42:29.320 --> 42:30.560
Who are you looking for?

42:37.040 --> 42:38.440
Can we talk inside?
